dere conto degli eventi messi in moto dal suo bestseller decenni prima. La ricerca di Cogburn per scoprire chi c'è dietro la manipolazione e il tormento mentale che incontra porta a un viaggio emotivo sulle montagne russe pieno di paura e pericolo, dove le cose non sono sempre così chiare come sembrano e dove le azioni del passato possono avere conseguenze terribili."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Reclusive and controversial author Bruce Cogburn is drawn out of hiding by an obsessive fan, forcing the novelist to confront a past that he thought he could escape, and to account for events set in motion by his bestseller decades earlier. Cogburn's search for who is behind the manipulation and mental torment he encounters leads to an emotional roller-coaster ride full of fear and danger, where things are not always as clear as they seem to be, and where past deeds can have dire consequences.","tagline":"What he created will destroy him."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zQCsKc3wGu3dVJDD5bRJCSMMVy0.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68t9YraLbv4BHikPmjcw7SOPJi3.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":916605,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zQCsKc3wGu3dVJDD5bRJCSMMVy0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zQCsKc3wGu3dVJDD5bRJCSMMVy0.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zQCsKc3wGu3dVJDD5bRJCSMMVy0.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zQCsKc3wGu3dVJDD5bRJCSMMVy0.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bSqpOGzaKBdGkBLmcm1JJIVryYy.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bSqpOGzaKBdGkB